    {
      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Use RTPP during a reproducible slow request to locate resource spikes and active operations, then investigate query details separately. A published aggregation experiment demonstrates this workflow. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/architecture/current/monitoring-alerts.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b02d4fdd3f924a47c07fcde4d83588b0ee67dc4eb51ac34a7e7b96fe875033b4",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:97038b171d6a2f6b726204fec8f175800d50b224505181787e05cb2772ca8043"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "RTPP may fail when db.currentOp() output exceeds its 4 MB per-sample maximum. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:ae459d322e469630ab4ca90feae91e992cbdf58cba783f70b5731de2988eae6c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:6a0719982b3e3468f1a6eacbc725daef4128fd36512bfcd6542a7918999b37e8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas documents one-second RTPP granularity. The Administration API can enable or disable RTPP, but cannot monitor its live panel data. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/architecture/current/monitoring-alerts.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:458a74ba42ed28c9c5b16fbfd32be824f69e27ee6a3032a8ebc6a6b7d4093d6b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:926af4c1fd3199def8753e5930f92cbb36dec8f1d599ef08e6724c8b1b02d0d0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "RTPP targets ongoing operations; Atlas separately describes Query Profiler as providing historical slow-operation samples for up to seven days. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
