    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "RTPP is Atlas's live triage panel for current database operations, network traffic, and host resources; it helps correlate query latency with resource pressure. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:931952cfa151cb17e1b1240e6e325862ceb40451cdcc2b73d490232cf1f9071d",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:b5880f6112f0194237c17e6e561b509dbb19dbbc8465c2a0744ab6ec9ee49a03"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "RTPP requires M10+ clusters. OneUptime and a Severalnines-authored answer independently corroborate this eligibility restriction. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:e8eeb203cd16d86eab17ea62885749b34393845a2bc47890cd8361713c88832e",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:1b2dc4a1e23562a265e185906bdda61687c348fbc0c7ea3384b8c54e813cd8e7",
            "ev:e54b2c1e42202486750c43506bca194cf3a573b253de5be58b77f4898bfb8325",
            "ev:e72ae0aea9b222ce652128009c03abb23156c5f1e42bb0fdbab9528befa56b3e"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "RTPP's Slowest Operations uses db.currentOp(); Hottest Collections uses mongotop, and execution-latency charts use serverStatus opLatencies. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:393c15149e2414abb0ad5394d997ffc972b98a8647fe614929f923ea13ce5a0b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:351098fdd87a8de8dd5008b778c30ea05fa263d2efd884bd1be9a2648fe40c98"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pausing RTPP freezes its display while underlying data collection continues; resuming restarts its line graphs with an empty display. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:31e0a752880003afdeb7b539cd30e8629ebffe1ed9370103a3755251830eb125",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:58484615081875af06d20b6ab3ad4add9e58d702677cb0dbe2a48e4f2eec3413",
            "ev:bf3f1afab31d0143007139e6ce8145b48f345972878959816889e5a034fe1444"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Kill Op control invokes db.killOp() on the selected running operation and requires an authorized project role. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:714ef035f27fa0635ba919c0d8c563f9c5a097b3c466c987a036ae059db05031",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:dd41e51c8b5099e8eb7a7b66cb380204daa8d5ef041eb2e649d5dad710d368b7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB documents one-second granularity for RTPP. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/architecture/current/monitoring-alerts.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b09cb25bcda69688a2357d617348275dc2f08d073cf17e409973f695e0850a95",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:af0f9e68638c08c3494cbf60ad96b47c5b855dcdc9949b2dc23ad801deec684a"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "RTPP uses mongostat for operation counters, mongotop for hot collections and db.currentOp() for the slowest current operations. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:0f38647a943b852c6a2471171028384b024661dc6cd14bab048590b136d367bb",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:1ba993c3abc030d7cdade3835bcbf752f3994cc1aba56981c5c8c291fbeca220"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB Search change-stream cursors can inflate query-targeting ratios, so a high ratio alone does not establish an application indexing defect. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:747733d6e20e7ffdc086fc2cd2985d412f607b1099e563ec6a2985a41ee53605",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:04de84a5ace18c24f2017a490e5ae7e124c6b15bdec65fe69ab44fb352311144"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Queryable Encryption hides affected collections from Hottest Collections and redacts query JSON involving encrypted fields. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/real-time-performance-panel.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:9c15e13bb39909772509eb504b0e92d186d27e242243701900231e0514dbfdd4",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:b2e0813aad7a0b2a31bfcfdfe28c8991c581f0926a312d88249258f5a2f0d9a9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vokint recommends pairing Atlas live operations and cluster signals with application OpenTelemetry traces; this is an integration recommendation, not proof that RTPP provides distributed tracing. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://invokfung.github.io/blog/2025/08/19/mongo_26_opentelemetry_observability/",
          "note": null,
